targeted: tests/test_conflict_marker_gate.py 20 passed; with R-152/R-153 gate tests: all pass.
full suite: see bottom of this log.

## not proven / residual
- a marker inside a binary file, or a marker that a PR adds and later commits remove, is not reported (net diff only — intended).
- the gate does not stop a direct push to main (branch protection is an owner setting; not changed).

